# DesignXP environment variables
#
# Leave these empty to run in DEMO MODE: onboarding and gameplay work, progress is stored
# in this browser only, and the leaderboard shows clearly labelled sample players.
#
# Fill them in to enable the shared, live leaderboard (see README > "Enable the live leaderboard").
# Both values are public client keys (Project Settings > API in Supabase).
# NEVER put the service_role key here or anywhere in frontend code.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
